{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/c99613bee27c0f5846e13e8507d43e52.avif?t=1771498058\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/f8b1776929899a7b9c1e4f25eaf2a31e.poster.avif?t=1771498058\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/f8b1776929899a7b9c1e4f25eaf2a31e.webm?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/f8b1776929899a7b9c1e4f25eaf2a31e.mp4?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dare to Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of indie horror hits <i>Massacre at the Mirage</i>, <i>Suffer the Night</i>, and <i>Terror at Oakheart</i>, comes <strong>Flesh Made Fear</strong>, the ultimate survival horror experience by Tainted Pact Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a world of horrifying experiments and occult rituals where every step plunges you deeper into madness. Featuring the survival mechanics that define the genre, reimagined with heart-stopping innovations, this game invites you to confront your fears like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you face the nightmare? Or will the nightmare consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/72758fe9c48d09a26ceebd5723417513.avif?t=1771498058\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/c69566f37cb2f37eb58163655347e9f2.poster.avif?t=1771498058\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/c69566f37cb2f37eb58163655347e9f2.webm?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/c69566f37cb2f37eb58163655347e9f2.mp4?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Horror, Reimagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flesh Made Fear</i> pays homage to the PSX-era survival horror that defined a generation. Drawing inspiration from the original <i>Resident Evil</i> trilogy, it masterfully blends intricate puzzles, heart-pounding combat, and a dread-filled atmosphere. But this isn\u2019t just a nostalgic throwback\u2014it\u2019s a bold evolution. Modernized controls, immersive cinematics, and a gripping story will keep you on the edge of your seat until the very last moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of an elite operative in the Reaper Intervention Platoon (R.I.P.), a covert task force deployed to neutralize Victor \u201cThe Dripper\u201d Ripper\u2014a brilliant but deranged former CIA agent. His sinister experiments have turned a desolate backwater town into a nightmare filled with grotesque monsters and mind-controlled thralls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: eliminate Ripper, unravel his chilling secrets, and survive the horrors lurking in his mansion-turned-laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step into the darkness? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/08b9616f92e2fc434a31c44f8246069a.avif?t=1771498058\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.poster.avif?t=1771498058\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.webm?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/7cb9afe0964305e7029cfabf225b7302.mp4?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror Meets Modern Innovations</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed and Dynamic Camera Angles</strong>: Relive the tension of classic fixed perspectives, seamlessly blending into modern rail and follow camera dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Saves</strong>: Strategically save your progress using collectible items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Tactically manage limited inventory slots with access to safe room storage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Narrative</strong>: Engage with intricate puzzles intertwined with the story, unlocking hidden secrets and new areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Natalie</strong> (less health, larger inventory) or <strong>Jack</strong> (greater health, smaller inventory).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character offers unique stats and storylines, enhancing replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Monsters &amp; Arsenal</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face grotesque abominations born of Ripper\u2019s twisted experiments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with weapons like pistols and grenade launchers, but beware\u2014ammo is limited, challenging your resourcefulness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/b225a5408a2f4783cb0fa96981d43e00.poster.avif?t=1771498058\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/b225a5408a2f4783cb0fa96981d43e00.webm?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/extras/b225a5408a2f4783cb0fa96981d43e00.mp4?t=1771498058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Bridge Too Far","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Excite Bike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Click...Click...Boom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Oh boy...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Macgyver would be proud.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Two Shells Left....","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Shoot first, Think never","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Ice...Coled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"Slurp, slurp...goes down smooth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"},{"name":"This Station Sucks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3316350/c36cebdbc9951c0b389b44abbf259c7517de33a4.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316350?t=1771498058","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771498058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/5644ce17271d2850fc6e276f73294da160f67406/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771498058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316350/5644ce17271d2850fc6e276f73294da160f67406/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771498058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains heavy depictions of blood, gore, horror, frightening scenes, violence, some nudity and is not suited for children and young people under the age of 18. \r\n\r\nAc